{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Streaming import with progress window (ESC and Cancel supported). Files and tracks are imported into REAPER one by one.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab On completion/abort: auto-close progress, then show summary dialog.\par}
