{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Toggle TCP folder children efficiently:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab If a selected track is a folder parent, toggle its TCP children visibility.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab If a selected track is a child, find its nearest folder parent and toggle that one.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Multi-selection supported with de-duplication. No full-project scan. Designed for very large sessions.\sa180\par}
}

